    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Talystro</i> is a rougelite-deckbuilder where you combine dice and cards to defeat your enemies. An army of numbers come to life, stands between our unlikely hero, the Math Mouse, and the wicked Necrodicer, who has started the forbidden ritual of <i>Talystro</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Number's Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of chipping away at your enemy's HP, you'll instead try and match their value to instantly take them out. Your cards contain one or more unfished calculations and you use your dice to complete them. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/22af9cdf74a0febd887058841c4db411.poster.avif?t=1754922170\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/22af9cdf74a0febd887058841c4db411.webm?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/22af9cdf74a0febd887058841c4db411.mp4?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outnumbered</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Necrodicer has begun the ritual of <i>Talystro</i>, and into this world are pouring twisted and corrupted beings, in the shapes of numbers. Each combat encounter you'll face multiple of these foul beasts, and it's up to you how to best deal with them and in what order!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/baf0ad1ae2e60bf00c6b9d4d960d5d17.poster.avif?t=1754922170\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/baf0ad1ae2e60bf00c6b9d4d960d5d17.webm?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/baf0ad1ae2e60bf00c6b9d4d960d5d17.mp4?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons of Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, upgrade and enchant your cards. As your enemies grow in value (and numbers!), finding cards to give you the flexibility to deal with them will be key. The calculations on your cards often refer to variables, like the number of dice for instance; Since these variables change during the round, the order of operations will be important -- countless possibilities and room for optimization! The cards can also contain modifiers, resources and spell effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the Cat's Away</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each combat encounter, you'll get to visit the shop where you can spend your well-earned cash. The shop will consist of randomly drafted modules, where you can do all the aforementioned card-stuff, upgrade your dice, acquire artifacts and tend to your wounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will consist of 3 acts each culminating in an Unique Boss encounter. We're also aiming for ascension-style modifiers to difficulty for subsequent playthroughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're hoping to release <i>Talystro</i> in Early Access later this year. Please check back for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Talystro</i> is a rougelite-deckbuilder where you combine dice and cards to defeat your enemies. An army of numbers come to life, stands between our unlikely hero, the Math Mouse, and the wicked Necrodicer, who has started the forbidden ritual of <i>Talystro</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Number's Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of chipping away at your enemy's HP, you'll instead try and match their value to instantly take them out. Your cards contain one or more unfished calculations and you use your dice to complete them. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/22af9cdf74a0febd887058841c4db411.poster.avif?t=1754922170\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/22af9cdf74a0febd887058841c4db411.webm?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/22af9cdf74a0febd887058841c4db411.mp4?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outnumbered</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Necrodicer has begun the ritual of <i>Talystro</i>, and into this world are pouring twisted and corrupted beings, in the shapes of numbers. Each combat encounter you'll face multiple of these foul beasts, and it's up to you how to best deal with them and in what order!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/baf0ad1ae2e60bf00c6b9d4d960d5d17.poster.avif?t=1754922170\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/baf0ad1ae2e60bf00c6b9d4d960d5d17.webm?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524740/extras/baf0ad1ae2e60bf00c6b9d4d960d5d17.mp4?t=1754922170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons of Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, upgrade and enchant your cards. As your enemies grow in value (and numbers!), finding cards to give you the flexibility to deal with them will be key. The calculations on your cards often refer to variables, like the number of dice for instance; Since these variables change during the round, the order of operations will be important -- countless possibilities and room for optimization! The cards can also contain modifiers, resources and spell effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the Cat's Away</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each combat encounter, you'll get to visit the shop where you can spend your well-earned cash. The shop will consist of randomly drafted modules, where you can do all the aforementioned card-stuff, upgrade your dice, acquire artifacts and tend to your wounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will consist of 3 acts each culminating in an Unique Boss encounter. We're also aiming for ascension-style modifiers to difficulty for subsequent playthroughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're hoping to release <i>Talystro</i> in Early Access later this year. Please check back for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Talystro is a rougelite-deckbuilder where you combine dice and cards to defeat your enemies. The catch? Instead of chipping away at their HP, you must macth their value. Collect, upgrade and enchant your cards. Discover game-breaking artifacts, power up your dice and defeat the Necrodicer!",
